## Fix

- Connected every runtime Grass/Ground Persistence setter to the Controller variables instead of the implicit `0.0` defaults.
- Added a Grass `AdvectGrid` reproject route matching the validated Ground V4c sign contract.
- Controller now computes `(previous_origin - current_origin) / window_size` once per frame for each channel and pushes it through the channel-specific DeltaControls array.
- Defaults: Grass Persistence `0.985`, Ground Persistence `0.995`.
